    "bbox": [
      58.56,
      540.04,
      555.05,
      631.39
    ],
    "text": "Showers or thundershowers may occur at a few places in Uva province and in Ampara and Batticaloa district after 2.00 p.m. Strong winds of about (30-40) kmph can be expected at times over North-central, North-western, Central and Southern provinces and in Mannar district.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri-Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
